NEARS-2984 QA — live query-count instrument (independent of the diff's own phpunit file)
Method: real Illuminate\Http\Request dispatched through the app's actual HTTP kernel
(full route/middleware/controller stack) against the live worktree backend on
127.0.0.1:8091, DB multi_food_db, with DB::listen()-equivalent query capture
(container 'db'->listen(), hooked via $app->booted()). Script:
Admin/qcount_nears2984.php (QA scratch instrument, removed after this run).

Precise-pattern counts (same SQL substrings the diff's own
Nears2984MultiDataBatchQueryCountTest.php asserts on):
  CATEGORY_Q = count of `select \`name\`, \`id\` from \`categories\` where \`id\` in (...)`
  FLASH_Q    = count of any query `from \`flash_sale_items\``
  ADDON_Q    = count of any query `from \`add_ons\``

=== AC1 GET /api/v1/categories/items/19?limit=25&offset=1 (zoneId=[1,2], moduleId=1) ===
20 items returned (category 19, zone-filtered).
STATUS=200  TOTAL_QUERIES=271  CATEGORY_Q=3  FLASH_Q=1  ADDON_Q=0
Marginal-cost re-run at limit=5 vs limit=20 (same route/headers):
  limit=5  -> TOTAL_QUERIES=94
  limit=20 -> TOTAL_QUERIES=263
  marginal cost = (263-94)/(20-5) = 11.3 queries/item (NOT 0/row, NOT <=12 total)
CATEGORY_Q/FLASH_Q/ADDON_Q stayed flat (3/1/0) at both sizes — the SPECIFIC
category/flash-sale/add-on batching this ticket targeted DOES hold (confirms the
fix's own claim), but the whole-request total is dominated by OTHER, untouched
per-item relations (see root-cause section below). Ticket threshold: <=12 total,
0/row. Baseline (Jira NEARS-2984 description): 703 queries / 25 items on
categories/items/1. Result: real ~2x improvement per item (28/item -> ~13/item),
but the AC's own <=12 bar is missed by ~20x.

=== AC2 GET /api/v1/items/popular?limit=25 (zoneId=[2], moduleId=1) ===
25 items returned.
STATUS=200  TOTAL_QUERIES=158  CATEGORY_Q=0  FLASH_Q=25  ADDON_Q=0
FLASH_Q=25 (one FlashSaleItem query PER ITEM) — this route is UNTOUCHED by the
diff. ItemController::get_popular_products() (app/Http/Controllers/Api/V1/
ItemController.php:494) calls Helpers::productListDataFormatting() (Helpers.php:353),
a SEPARATE function from product_data_formatting() — NOT part of this diff's
files_changed (Helpers.php diff only touches product_data_formatting/
addon_data_formatting/cart_product_data_formatting/wishlist_data_formatting).
productListDataFormatting() calls product_discount_calculate($item, $item->price,
$item->store, true) with NO 5th ($prefetchedFlashSale) arg (Helpers.php:356), so
product_discount_calculate's own per-item FlashSaleItem::Active()->whereHas(...)
->first() (Helpers.php:1992-1997) still fires once per row — the exact pre-fix
N+1 pattern the ticket named this route as having. Baseline (Jira): 186 queries/
25 items. Post: 158/25 — no real fix landed on this code path (measured drop is
noise/unrelated, not attributable to this diff, since the diff never touches this
function).

